    name: Elk Grove
    county: Sacramento County
    blurb: Elk Grove's many newer subdivisions mean lots of gas fireplaces, prefabricated fireplaces and second-story laundry rooms with long dryer vents, alongside older homes near Old Town that still burn wood.
  - id: roseville
